WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
A ring road.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:06.050
Beside it, a cluster of big
stores, and a huge free car park.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.710
It's clean and attractive, and
one landlord runs the whole site.

4
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.890
Back in the town centre, a
shopping street is quiet.

5
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.050
Out-of-town parks are easy to drive to.

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.970
So who loses when one
opens, if anyone at all?

7
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:25.010
In this mission, you'll weigh a
retail park's costs and gains,

8
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.530
for people and for the environment.

9
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.510
Then you'll see how
planners decide where shops,

10
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.210
sports grounds and parks should go.

11
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.590
Your mission: find out
who gains, and who loses,

12
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.630
when an out-of-town retail park opens.
